                <h2>Pre-Launch Checklist: Is Your Asset Pool Ready?</h2>
<p>The most common challenge before a new product launch isn't insufficient budget—it's insufficient creative assets. One home goods team once had to pause their campaign and reshoot because their assets ran out within the first week, missing the peak traffic window.</p>
<p>This checklist helps you complete asset preparation before launching paid campaigns.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Part 1: Asset Type Planning Checklist</h2>
<p>For cold launch, prepare <strong>at least 20-30 creative assets</strong> covering four content categories:</p>
<h3>1. Product Showcase (40%)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Multi-angle product close-ups (minimum 5 shots)</li>
<li>[ ] Usage scenario demonstrations</li>
<li>[ ] Dynamic core feature highlights</li>
<li>[ ] Unboxing videos</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Filming tip</strong>: Each product showcase should be 15-30 seconds with bright, focused visuals.</p>
<h3>2. Lifestyle/Scenario Content (30%)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Real user scenarios (at least 3 different settings)</li>
<li>[ ] Pain point to solution comparison</li>
<li>[ ] Lifestyle integration</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Script structure</strong>: Hook in first 3 seconds → Product value in middle → Call to action at end.</p>
<h3>3. Trust-Building Content (20%)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Factory/warehouse footage</li>
<li>[ ] Quality inspection processes</li>
<li>[ ] Brand/team story</li>
</ul>
<h3>4. Urgency Content (10%)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Limited-time countdown</li>
<li>[ ] Low stock hints</li>
<li>[ ] Launch-exclusive offers</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Part 2: Asset Production Execution Steps</h2>
<h3>Step 1: Competitor Analysis (2-3 hours)</h3>
<ul>
<li>Analyze top 20 videos in your category</li>
<li>Document common patterns in viral content</li>
<li>Note what users mention in comments</li>
</ul>
<h3>Step 2: Script Templates Ready</h3>
<p>Prepare 3-5 reusable script templates:</p>
<p><strong>Template A: Pain Point → Solution</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>First 3s: Show user pain point scenario<br />
Middle 10s: Product enters, solution demonstrated<br />
Final 5s: Before/after comparison + CTA</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Template B: Review/Unboxing</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>First 3s: Hook or product reveal<br />
Middle 15s: Feature walkthrough<br />
Final 3s: Personal recommendation</p>
</blockquote>
<h3>Step 3: Batch Shooting</h3>
<ul>
<li>Shoot 3-5 products per session</li>
<li>2-3 variations per feature</li>
<li>Backup angles for every shot</li>
</ul>
<h3>Step 4: Editing Priority</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Priority</th>
<th>Content Type</th>
<th>Delivery Time</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>P0</td>
<td>Initial test assets (5-8 pieces)</td>
<td>3 days before launch</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>P1</td>
<td>Scenario expansion (10-15 pieces)</td>
<td>1 day before launch</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>P2</td>
<td>Backup/A-B test (5-10 pieces)</td>
<td>Within 24 hours after launch</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<h2>Part 3: Upload &amp; Format Specifications</h2>
<h3>Video Specs Checklist</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Resolution: 1080x1920 (vertical 9:16)</li>
<li>[ ] Duration: 15-60 seconds (15-30s recommended)</li>
<li>[ ] Format: MP4</li>
<li>[ ] File size: Under 500MB</li>
<li>[ ] Thumbnail: 16:9, clear, no text watermarks</li>
</ul>
<h3>Asset Naming Convention</h3>
<p>Format: <code>Date_ProductName_ContentType_Version</code></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Example: <code>20250115_massagegun_review_v2.mp4</code></p>
</blockquote>
<h3>Pre-Upload Checklist</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Auto-captions disabled (TikTok generates automatically)</li>
<li>[ ] Music/sound effects copyright-cleared</li>
<li>[ ] Cover image free of competitor logos or sensitive terms</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Part 4: Cold Launch Asset Recommendations</h2>
<h3>Minimum Viable Asset Volume</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Daily Budget</th>
<th>Recommended Assets</th>
<th>Products Covered</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>$100-300</td>
<td>15-20 pieces</td>
<td>1-2 products</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>$300-500</td>
<td>25-35 pieces</td>
<td>2-3 products</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>$500+</td>
<td>40+ pieces</td>
<td>3-5 products</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Asset Lifespan Estimates</h3>
<ul>
<li>Viral asset lifespan: 7-14 days</li>
<li>Average asset lifespan: 3-5 days</li>
<li>Upload new assets daily to keep the pool fresh</li>
</ul>
<h3>FAQ</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What if assets underperform?</strong><br />
- Check first 3-second retention rate first<br />
- Try different thumbnails and openings<br />
- Keep 2-3 assets running simultaneously</p>
<p><strong>Q: What if assets become repetitive?</strong><br />
- Reshoot new scenarios<br />
- Adjust editing pace<br />
- Change voiceover or background music</p>
<hr />
<h2>Final Pre-Launch Checklist</h2>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Total asset count meets minimum requirements</li>
<li>[ ] All four content types covered</li>
<li>[ ] All assets pass format checks</li>
<li>[ ] Naming convention consistent</li>
<li>[ ] Backup assets uploaded and ready</li>
<li>[ ] Team aligned on update frequency</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>The key to cold launch success isn't perfection in single assets—it's continuous supply capability.</strong> Plan ahead, produce in batches, optimize in real-time, and you'll maintain creative advantage in competitive markets.</p>
